ghtly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Eddy Current","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e0f3c00a8b2cbccb8f1f1b318026aeee.png","desc":"Temporarily increases reload speed and handling after sprinting or while amplified. This effect is improved when you are amplified."},{"name":"Dragonfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c87b03bb6d56b393f8582e128b337332.png","desc":"Precision kills create an elemental damage explosion."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Keep Away","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/597cd0f1c5fe1f7681a1c129f8b958dd.png","desc":"Increases reload, range, and accuracy when no targets are in close proximity."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Enlightened Action","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/cee13d00e65346dacc05562c80f537da.png","desc":"Dealing damage improves reload speed and handling."},{"name":"Trickle Charge","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/17b696e766f345273ddfdda22c8a06f6.png","desc":"Receiving or discharging Bolt Charge partially loads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Discord","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3112a65a875b759a21ab94b832d04279.png","desc":"Final blows with another weapon grant this weapon increased speed for aiming down sights, accuracy, and airborne effectiveness for a short time. When Discord is active, final blows refund ammo."},{"name":"Gutshot Straight","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5c4c785bde7b9808d48ded283256750e.png","desc":"Aiming down sights increases body shot damage, decreases target acquisition."},{"name":"Rewind Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a201fd61905b802867b677cf927e6e04.png","desc":"When this weapon's magazine is empty, it refills from reserves based on the number of hits."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Rolling Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/086174f30d9fbf5e68f473dac9eda710.png","desc":"Final blows grant Bolt Charge.\nWhile amplified, final blows grant additional Bolt Charge."},{"name":"Onslaught","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7e07db21ba2b35751507256e46230616.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon increase its rate of fire."},{"name":"Paracausal Affinity","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6cdbccd2dc6395b60163984481b334eb.png","desc":"Final blows of energy types matching this weapon's alignment grant increased damage for a short period of time. Light final blows boost Arc, Solar, and Void weapons. Darkness final blows boost Stasis and Strand weapons."},{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Target Lock","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/72be46e05195a95ae1307a684f68456b.png","desc":"Damage increases the longer this weapon remains on a target."},{"name":"Voltshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a71ffb1cb221ea64fa77ab473f8a3a61.png","desc":"Reloading this weapon after defeating a target overcharges this weapon for a short period of time, causing it to jolt on its next hit."},{"name":"Gear Shift","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a9d69d341b43e53428546d2090c63ae8.png","desc":"Reloading after a final blow or becoming amplified grants a period of increased damage. Stacks 5x."},{"name":"Sword Logic","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/152c94f1a02446aebdeda3ccca2cf3c7.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage. The strength and duration of the bonus increases when more powerful targets are defeated."},{"name":"Cascade Point","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/fd17b30233d244fc7115315633906f6a.png","desc":"Final blows or sustained precision hits with another weapon increase this weapon's rate of fire for a short duration."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage. While this buff is active, grenade or melee kills of 